[{"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:52:07Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Cold shoulder", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:52:07Z", "username": "Nikhil Borra", "text": "Cold shoulder", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:52:22Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Correct. A cold shoulder of mutton (or beef). It was a polite, culinary way of saying, \"The party is over; go home.\"", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:52:44Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Vats 10", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:53:03Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Next:", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:53:42Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "2. This 19th-century idiom comes from the world of hunting, specifically with hounds. When a dog chases a nocturnal mammal - like a raccoon - into a tree, the dog stays at the base and barks to alert the hunter. However, raccoons are notorious for \"leaping\" from one tree canopy to another. What phrase must it give rise to?", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:53:55Z", "username": "Abhishek Vats", "text": "Leap trees and bounds", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:53:55Z", "username": "Sidhesh K K", "text": "Barking up wrong trrew", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:54:06Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "Barking up the wrong tree is correct", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:54:18Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "an idiom for following a mistaken line of thought", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:54:28Z", "username": "pratik.s.chandarana", "text": "Our version here is - Pissing up the wrong pole 😬", "role": "chat", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}, {"timestamp": "2026-03-02T16:54:47Z", "username": "Kartikey Pradhan", "text": "“bhai tu fir galat train pakad raha hai”", "role": "hint", "is_correct": null, "has_media": false, "media": null}]